NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7196) - AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen adding multiple custom bbcode RichTextEffect using install_effect(effect) at _ready time, only the effect of the first installed effect is rendered and any following still show their unmodified text including tags. This does not happen when instead assigning a new Array to custom_effects which already contains all new effects. When instead appending to the array, no effect gets shown.\n\nI would expect for install_effect() to behave like assigning a new array.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7d523be-c655-4282-8267-b33bf5b15581)\n\nAltering the text in the running project does update everything correctly for all three methods shown.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a custom script for RichTextLabel with something like this:\n\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tcustom_effects.clear()\n\tinstall_effect(load(\"uid://c2vp3pnlokpg2\")) # Only this effect works\n\tinstall_effect(load(\"uid://3ke1uaie6igq\"))\n\tinstall_effect(load(\"uid://dsfc7ow5qjeet\"))\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[texteffecttest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19089575/texteffecttest.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.c